    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +4 and ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Recovers HP with sweet treats\n- Damage reduction rate 26%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When 4 or more Super Class allies are on the team*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- All allies' ATK 40%{passiveImg:up_g} for 3 turns\n*When there is another \"Peppy Gals\", \"Joined Forces\" or\n\"Otherworld Warriors\" Category ally on the team*\n- ATK & DEF 255%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- Guards all attacks\n*When HP is 50% or more at the start of turn*\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n- Survives K.O. attacks (up to once within a turn)\n*When HP is 50% or less at the start of turn*\n- {passiveImg:once}Recovers 55% HP\n- {passiveImg:once}Damage reduction rate 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Recovers 25% HP\n- Damage reduction rate 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}ATK 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}{passiveImg:forever}All allies' ATK 55%{passiveImg:up_g}",
